        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant C as Client\n    participant O as order-service\n    participant I as inventory-service\n    participant P as payment-service\n    participant PG as Payment Gateway\n    participant MQ as RabbitMQ\n    participant N as notification-service\n\n    Note over C,PG: Шаги 1–11 как в успешном сценарии:&lt;br/&gt;заказ создан, резерв активен, платёж инициирован\n\n    PG-&gt;&gt;P: webhook payment.failed\n    P-&gt;&gt;MQ: publish payment.failed\n    MQ--&gt;&gt;O: consume payment.failed\n    O-&gt;&gt;O: status = CANCELLED\n    O-&gt;&gt;MQ: publish order.cancelled\n    MQ--&gt;&gt;I: consume order.cancelled\n    I-&gt;&gt;I: ⚙ release reservation&lt;br/&gt;(КОМПЕНСАЦИЯ)\n    MQ--&gt;&gt;N: consume order.cancelled\n    N-&gt;&gt;N: send email об отмене\n\n    Note over O,I: Данные согласованы:&lt;br/&gt;резерв снят, заказ отменён&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="jrwpsjGuzLij1hNiOoy2-124">
